# Conformance probe pack for `until:` items of a `rest` group (spec 0.22,
# ruling 15, with spec 0.21: a list to the end of its extent). Public. No
# kinds. Most significant bit first.
#
#   names  items to the end of the message, each 7-bit characters up to NUL
format     conformance-long-until-rest
version    0.22.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
group   probe.names  rest
  field  probe.tag  until:0  chars:ascii7
end
